From d200f3772b0e655b34ae97e74ccc2e240752c892 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TrinityXSX <trinityxsx@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 13:58:36 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add live Touchpad PC input switching and session handoff

Allow switching [input] remote live from the Touchpad quick menu (OFF, BROWSER + PIN, BROWSER + SENDER) and persisting the change to trinityxsx-library.profile. Support remote = both so TCP 8361 and UDP 9396 can run concurrently without dropping an open browser session. Report live PC session state (idle/connected/capturing, source, peer IP) in the Touchpad menu and netinput.txt, expose a PIN-free LAN-only GET /status endpoint for txin-sender diagnostics, automatically mute DualSense stick drift during active PC capture with instant pad reclaim, and offer a one-click temporary XInput hide override that auto-restores when the PC session ends.
